# S016294 candidate summary

Adds the path-preserving translation of
`include/uapi/linux/netfilter/xt_state.h`.

The candidate exposes exactly the selected public UAPI items:

- `XT_STATE_BIT`, preserving `(1 << ((ctinfo) % IP_CT_IS_REPLY + 1))` through
  the translated `ip_conntrack_info` wrapper and `IP_CT_IS_REPLY` constant;
- `XT_STATE_INVALID` as `1 << 0`;
- `XT_STATE_UNTRACKED` as `1 << (IP_CT_NUMBER + 1)`; and
- `#[repr(C)] struct xt_state_info { statemask: c_uint }`.

No substitute netfilter API, padding, packing, tests, runtime behavior, or
extra selected items were added.
